* First, the construction of the stretch of the Russian Federation Boulevard on the north side from the Total gas station to the corner of City Center Boulevard to Phnom Penh City Center (formerly Boeung Kak Development Zone) and a 1-meter sewer to release water from the river Monivong Blvd and Russian Federation Blvd.
* Second: Adjust the traffic system at the intersection of two deer between City Center Blvd. (R6) and Czech Republic Blvd. Round this circle, keeping the two deer statues intact.
