The Documentation Center of Cambodia, as one of the leading institutions in the study of Khmer Rouge history, has carried out research and advocated for reconciliation in Anlong Veng district. In addition to its headquarters in Phnom Penh, the Documentation Center of Cambodia has also established research centers in the provinces. Anlong Veng was the first location where the Center established its first research office, the Anlong Veng Peace Center.
