(Kratie): Ms. Kham Sopheap, Deputy Governor of Kratie Province, said that some young people mistakenly thought that Valentine's Day on February 14 is Valentine's Day, which requires couples to give each other souvenirs or Reaching out to commit misconduct or other crimes that degrade one's honor and family as well.
Ms. Kham Sopheap said this on the occasion that she and Dr. Kao Madeleine, Director of the Department of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, on February 8, 2020, organized a program to educate the students of Thmor Kre High School, Chit Borei District, Kratie Province. .
According to the Deputy Governor, Valentine's Day is a day when everyone has to show their love to the people they love and respect, such as: relatives, friends, teachers. Especially the parents.
