She said that the field of Buddhism has created many programs to contribute to building peace and harmony in the society through educational institutions and pagodas, etc. to better understand the unique values of Khmer culture, traditions and customs as the national identity. And participate in preserving, developing, promoting national culture and reducing negative cultural influences from abroad. But there are still some people who do not respect and follow what their ancestors forbade.
Ms. Kham Sopheap added that a young person who supports the integration of moral education programs into schools is very important for the development, maintenance of peace and harmony in society. In that, the field of religion teaches people to know truth, righteousness, merit and sin.
Specialists: Chest pain due to blockage or narrowing of the heart is a warning sign that can die suddenly.
(Phnom Penh): Chest pain is a symptom that can be caused by many diseases, including chest pain caused by heart disease is a symptom that can endanger life. This is according to a team of cardiologists speaking at a medical seminar on the morning of February 8, 2020 at the Sofitel Hotel.
Chest pain may occur when one or more coronary arteries become blocked or constricted, or small arteries of the heart become deformed, reducing blood supply to the heart muscle, experts say. . This pain often occurs when trying to run or climb stairs and disappears after a 10 to 15 minute break.
It is a chest tightness in the middle of the chest or left side and can spread to the neck, left jaw, shoulders and left arm. In case of these symptoms, the patient should consult a doctor immediately. This is according to a group of doctors in a medical seminar under the theme "It is time for us to provide maximum benefits to patients with chest pain."
Prof. Dr. Sok Chour continued, "This patient can be life threatening if not treated properly and in a timely manner, as we already know that in the world today, atherosclerosis. "Heart disease is the leading cause of death because more than 8 million people die every year from the disease."
According to this expert, there are many factors that cause chest pain or coronary heart disease. He summarized that the main factors are age, disease and food.
At the same time, Dr. Liu Qin, a cardiologist at Calmette Hospital, said that chest pain is a disease that occurs suddenly and patients show symptoms in many forms. He said that some people may show a heavy feeling in the chest or heartburn like a stomach ache and start sweating, sometimes can cause nausea.
"People who have the symptoms that I have informed you should see a cardiologist for treatment because this disease is life-threatening," said Dr. Liu Qing.
Most coronary heart disease occurs in middle age from the age of 30, but in Cambodia we see people with heart disease from the age of 20. This is according to Dr. Liu Qing.
Meanwhile, another professor, Chhun Lay, a cardiologist at Calmette Hospital, also confirmed that coronary heart disease is not a common disease to be considered. He advised patients to seek treatment at the Calmette Hospital Cardiology Center, where a team of cardiologists from France were trained and equipped.
