(Phnom Penh): After graduating, many students always wish to study for a master's degree at universities around the world, especially in large countries such as the United States, France, Australia, New Zealand, etc., requiring students to study directly. In those countries and will spend a lot of money.
From now on, it is no longer a concern for students who want to pursue a master's degree in accordance with American standards, just by studying at the American University of Phnom Penh (AUPP), they will receive a master's degree in business administration. With higher quality, especially they will not have to spend a lot of money or away from family because they can study in Cambodia.
AUPP Master's Degree aims to prepare graduates for business success, both domestically and internationally, in Southeast Asia and around the world. With a standard American curriculum and taught by American and Western professors with many years of experience, students will develop knowledge and skills in business management, leadership and entrepreneurship strategies.
The curriculum is closely monitored under the Committee for Supervision of the Master of Curriculum in Business Administration and is a new curriculum developed with the active participation of many experts, including Professors, students, alumni, staff and other professionals.
Students only need one and a half years to complete this master's degree. Students study three days a week, Monday, Wednesday and Friday from 5:30 to 8:30 p.m.
This Master of Business Administration is a great opportunity for students who want to pursue a higher quality higher education. AUPP is accepting applications from now on. The new course starts on May 11, 2020.
