Two Administrative Police Stations in Koh Rong City, Sihanoukville Province Built by General Neth Savoeun
(Preah Sihanouk): On the morning of February 7, 2020, Brigadier General Chin Vitya, Deputy Commissioner of Human Resource Planning and Representative of Major General Chuon Narin, Provincial Police Commissioner, led the commission to lay the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of the administrative police station. Koh Rong and Koh Rong Samloem are located in Doeum Thkov village, Koh Touch village, Koh Rong city, Preah Sihanouk province.
