The AII Language Center and the American Intercontinental School, which are open to the public, include the AII Language Center and the American Intercontinental School, Choam Chao Branch, Phsar Thmei Branch, and Chroy Changvar Branch, which will take place on the 15th. On February 16, 2020, from 8 am to 5 pm. This is according to the management of the center and the school. The AII Language Center accepts students for enrollment on a daily basis.
