Also today, students from all walks of life who wish to study at the AII Language Center and the American Intercontinental School can take the entrance test for free, he added.
Please be informed that AII Language Center is a leading English, Chinese and Thai language educational institution in Cambodia with a focus on quality, discipline and service. The American Intercontinental School is an educational institution that focuses on general education from kindergarten to high school, focusing on quality, discipline, and service.
