According to Koy Sao, next week's hearing will begin debating the facts between 2012 and the arrest of Kem Sokha on the night of September 3, 2017. Mr. Koy Sao announced that in order to facilitate the debate on this fact, he would like to divide the facts into two parts: the facts of the accused's secret reconciliation with foreigners and the facts that led to the conflict.
As for the facts of the secret agreement with the foreigners, they will debate the formation of the CNRP on July 17, 2012, the 2013 election and the post-election events of 2013 until the arrest of the accused. .
Mr. Koy Sao also said that after concluding the facts of the reconciliation with foreigners, that would lead to the debate of facts, causing controversy before leading to the questioning of witnesses.
The trial is part of a series of debates between prosecutors, civil party lawyers, defense lawyers and defendants to find out whether Kem Sokha has indeed committed peace acts with foreigners as alleged. Yes or no?
At this stage, prosecutors and civil party lawyers will make every effort to prove to the trial judge that Kem Sokha did indeed make peace with foreigners, while the defense attorneys for the nine defendants How to show the judge that the accused Kem Sokha did not commit acts of peace or so-called treason as alleged.
