The president said he supports free trade talks between the two countries and must speed up the preparation of documents leading to the signing as soon as possible.
The President emphasized that in January 2019, he also raised the issue of law enforcement in Sihanoukville, and Samdech stopped online gambling. The President expressed his sincere appreciation to Cambodia for taking this step.
The president said the Chinese government would encourage Chinese investors to invest in Cambodia and import Cambodian products into China. He called on Cambodia to improve the investment climate in Cambodia, which supports investment and business.
The president asked to look at what Chinese investors face when investing in Cambodia to find measures to help those investors.
Chinese President: Samdech Techo and Cambodians are loyal friends of China
(Beijing, China): The presence of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and his eldest son, Hun Manet, and his delegation on Chinese soil at a time when China is suffering from a coronary heart disease. It is the most meaningful visit for Chinese President Xi Jinping.
On February 5, 2020, Samdech Techo Hun Sen led a delegation to visit Beijing, China. The visit of Samdech Techo and his delegation became the first visit of a friendly country leader to China after the economic powerhouse was hit hard by a coronary heart disease.
Since China suffered from the disease, many visiting leaders of friendly countries have resorted to fear of the disease and shut down flights to China. The gesture was seen as an act of discrimination against China and left China alone as this Asian nation needed protection.
China's top leaders, both President Xi Jinping and Prime Minister Li Keqiang, welcomed the visit of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and his delegation with deepest sympathy.
In a warm and cordial meeting, President Xi Jinping expressed his deep gratitude for the deep loyalty of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the Cambodian people to the Chinese government and people. . This was confirmed by Mr. Kao Kim Hourn, Minister accompanying the Prime Minister who attended the meeting.
The Chinese President expressed his deep gratitude to the Prime Minister for his strong support for China. He considered Samdech Techo's visit to be a great source of confidence and strength for China. In particular, expressed support and trust in China.
The President stated that Samdech Techo and the Cambodian people are sincere friends and true loyalty to the people and China. In return for this sincere water, President Xi Jinping welcomed Samdech Techo's visit to China at any time and he will meet with Samdech Techo often to strengthen cooperation between the two countries.
In this meeting, Mr. Xi Jinping announced to take care of Cambodian citizens and students living and studying in China as citizens as children of China.
In front of the Prime Minister, Mr. Xi Jinping unceasingly announced that he would assist Cambodia in all circumstances to promote development. He also announced the need for assistance for Cambodia, which is a loyal friend.
President Xi Jinping agrees with Samdech Techo: Corona infection rate is low compared to other diseases, but panic disorder is a big problem
(Beijing-China): In a meeting on the evening of February 5, 2020 in Beijing, Chinese President Xi Jinping expressed the views of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, that fear is a big problem. In fact, the incidence of coronavirus pneumonia is very low compared to other diseases.
Kao Kim Hourn, Minister of the Prime Minister, said that during this important meeting, the President of China informed Samdech Techo Hun Sen that the disease can be cured and some patients have been cured. Some are recovering well.
The president of the superpower assessed that the disease was only a transitional disease, and he pointed out that in recent years, China has also suffered from "Sa" disease. The president claimed that the Chinese government believes in its ability to tackle and eradicate the disease.
Taking this opportunity, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also shared his concerns with the people affected by the "Corona" virus and stressed that he supported the Chinese government for the measures taken in the past. He stressed that his presence in China now shows solidarity with China and sympathy with the Chinese people.
During a message to Cambodians across the country at the Peace Palace on the morning of January 30, 2020 regarding the new coronary heart disease in Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the disease that Cambodia is The real experience now is not just a new respiratory illness caused by the coronavirus, but a frightening disease caused by information poisoning.
As of February 5, 2020, Cambodia has not had a new case of coronavirus, only one case of Chinese.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen tells Chinese President that he does not need to wear a mask if he does not need to visit China
Taking this opportunity, Samdech Techo also shared his worries with the people affected by the disease "Corona". Samdech Techo emphasized that he supported the Chinese government for the measures taken in the past.
The Prime Minister said that last year the two countries signed a joint political agreement, and no one could break the friendship between China and Cambodia.
Samdech Techo said that his presence in China now shows solidarity with China and sympathy with the Chinese people.
President Xi Jinping informed Samdech Techo that he was really pleased to meet him again in Beijing. He added that the Chinese people, as well as the Chinese government, are facing an outbreak of coronary heart disease, and that the Cambodian people, especially students living in China, are paying close attention.
The President emphasized that the Prime Minister had announced his support for China and that Cambodia had joined China in mourning. He is really thankful for the spirit of Cambodia.
He also pointed out that from last year, the relationship between Cambodia and China began in the new era, pursuing a policy of common destiny and can take the relationship between the two countries to a new level from now on.
"If the Chinese government does not take immediate and clear action, coronary heart disease could be even more dangerous," he said.
So far, the Chinese government has set up three commissions to fight the disease, he said. The Chinese government has received the support and congratulations of the World Health Organization (WHO) for its efforts to tackle the disease, he said.
Wuhan has a population of about 10 million, and Hubei has a population of between 60 and 70 million, the president said. Due to clear and effective action, the spread of the disease has been reduced.
"Fear is a big problem. In fact, the rate of infection is very low compared to other diseases," he said.
The president said that according to the research, the disease can be cured and some patients have recovered and some are recovering well.
The president assessed the disease as just a transitional one. The president also pointed out that in recent years, China has also suffered from "Sa" disease. The president also stressed that the Chinese government has a disease in its ability to deal with it.
The President said that he was very grateful to the Prime Minister for his strong support for China. This means that the visit of Samdech Techo Prime Minister is to give high confidence to China. Not only that, Samdech Techo and the Cambodian government continue to support and trust China.
The president stressed that there are Cambodian students in China and the Chinese government will take care of Chinese citizens and students, such as Chinese citizens and their descendants.
The president stressed that Cambodia is a loyal friend of China. The President sent a message of thanks to His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni and His Majesty Queen Mother Norodom Monineath Sihanouk for sharing their plight with the Chinese government.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen tells Chinese President that there are three reasons for Samdech to pay a working visit to Beijing
BEIJING (Reuters) - Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen has become the first Chinese leader to pay a working visit to China amid an outbreak of coronary heart disease in China. On February 05, 2020. Samdech Techo Hun Sen's working visit has attracted a lot of attention and surprise from the Chinese and global media.
In a meeting with Chinese President Xi Jinping, Samdech Techo Hun Sen pointed out that there are three main reasons for his visit to China. This was confirmed by Mr. Kao Kim Hourn, Minister accompanying the Prime Minister, who attended the meeting between Samdech Techo and the President of China.
In front of the Chinese President, Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his condolences and shared his difficulties with the Chinese government over the outbreak of this respiratory disease. Samdech Techo Hun Sen also praised the Chinese government's efforts to fight and prevent respiratory diseases.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also criticized the attitude of some countries that seem to be using the disease caused by the "Corona" virus as a psychological war, causing fear to the people. Li Keqiang told Cambodian Prime Minister that China will do everything possible to make the people living there not be afraid of the coronavirus
BEIJING, Feb. 5 (Xinhua) - Chinese Premier Li Keqiang confirmed to Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen at a meeting on the evening of February 5, 2020 that the Chinese government will do everything in its power to make people live. In China, do not be afraid of diseases caused by coronavirus.
Li Keqiang confirmed that the Chinese government and people are fighting coronavirus. Through Samdech Techo Hun Sen's visit to China now shows strong support for China in difficult times.
As the world's first leader to travel to China during the Coronavirus outbreak, Hun Sen told the Chinese Prime Minister that what was important was not the coronavirus but the fear of the people.
Samdech Techo Prime Minister considered that the problem of coronary heart disease is a psychological war that is frightening people and some opinions accuse the Royal Government of exchanging the lives of Cambodians with Cambodian-Chinese relations.
However, Li Keqiang claimed that the Chinese government and people are now fighting the new image, and hoped that China would be able to fight the disease successfully.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen is happy and warm in his heart after meeting with China's top leaders who claim to take care of Cambodian citizens and students not to get coronary heart disease
(Beijing): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the night of February 5, 2020, before leading a high-level Cambodian delegation from Beijing, China to return to Cambodia after the meeting between China's top leaders. He then posted a message expressing joy and warmth in his heart that the Chinese leader claimed that he would take care of the Cambodian people and students in Wuhan not to be infected with pneumonia caused by the coronavirus.
However, Samdech Techo Hun Sen still expressed his regret that he did not meet the Cambodian students who were staying in Wuhan in person, but he hoped to do so in the future.
"I wish all my compatriots and nephews happiness and good luck, especially to avoid all diseases, including coronary heart disease." Daily Summary of National and International News on February 05, 2020
