Duke Dr. Kouch Mengly said that most snoring problems occur in obese or overweight people. Why? Because when we are fat, we grow fat in it, then there is a problem that makes us sleep and breathe is blocked.
He said that when breathing is congested, the sound of kurt will come out. People with snoring problems can not get enough sleep, so every day they are sleepy and even tired. Not only that, even those who sleep nearby have to suffer from sleep disturbances.
According to Dr. Kouch Mengly, we can stop snoring by just following the following points:
* 2: Weight loss: Gaining weight or being overweight is also a reason for us to snore. So to stop snoring is to lose weight. But if we snore before we are obese, then weight loss is ineffective.
* 3: Stop drinking: I often observe that people who have never snored after drinking and they will snore because the muscles behind their throats. So if they can stop drinking, they may stop snoring.
* 4: Nasal hygiene: If your nose is tight or difficult to breathe while sleeping, you will snore. So clean your nose every day before going to bed.
