Senior Minister Kun Kim said: "In the last few years, disasters in Cambodia have been caused by natural disasters, floods, droughts, windstorms, lightning strikes, riverbank fires, infectious diseases and so on." In particular, in 2019 there was a drought, a shortage of water and a drought in the rainy season agriculture.
