The meeting was held on the morning of February 3, 2020 at the Ministry of Economy and Finance, with the participation of senior ministers, ministers and leaders of relevant ministries and institutions of the Royal Government to review and discuss. Two main agendas:
* 1: Progress of implementation of reform measures:
Overall, the ministries in charge have implemented the measures with remarkable results and received high praise from the private sector and the general public.
