* 2: Improving the ease of doing business in Cambodia:
The Ease of Doing Business rating system can be an important fundamental tool for promoting competitiveness and attracting investment in Cambodia, as this assessment is realistic, uses a specific approach and provides ownership. High to the Royal Government.
In this sense, improving the scores and rankings of the above indicators will make it easier and more competitive to do business in Cambodia.
The Royal Government will continue to review these priority indicators in order to put in place effective measures that can be achieved in the short term to improve the business environment as well as ensure better competitiveness in Cambodia.
