(Phnom Penh): During inspections in the field of public functions throughout 2019, the Ministry of Public Works found cases of overpayment of 7,198,135,514 riels, but these funds were diverted back to the treasury.
This was said at the opening ceremony of the meeting of the Ministry of Public Works held at the Phnom Penh Hotel on February 4, 2020 under the chairmanship of Minister Pich Bunthen. The conference will close on February 5 tomorrow.
Minister Pich Bunthen presented some of the achievements of the Ministry of Public Works in 2019, including:
* Developed and implemented the standard documents related to officials, such as the increase of social security system, the payment of salaries every two weeks through the banking system from the beginning of January 2019.
* Continuously increase salaries and allowances for civil servants, the armed forces, civil servants in the judiciary, prison guards, sub-national administrative council members, village members and contracted officials, especially the unit price increase of salaries Basics and installment of functional compensation.
* Developed the capacity of civil servants of ministries and institutions through various trainings and workshops, especially at the Royal School of Administration.
* Developed and implemented a system to evaluate and recognize model public service units in the field of education and health, and awarded incentives to 40 model units, including 10 high schools and 30 referral hospitals.
* Established management system for civil servants through information technology system, such as information system for civil servants, contract management system, overtime management system for teachers and contract teaching management system.
* Developed a mechanism for providing information about public services through the development of mobile applications and launched an electronic gateway website.
* Developed and announced the implementation of the Strategic Plan (2018-2023) of the Ministry of Public Function, which is a plan to support the National Strategic Development Plan (2019-2023) and the Rectangular Strategy Phase 4 of the Royal Government in the 6th legislature.
* Prepared the draft public administration reform program 2020-2030, which will be submitted to the head of the Royal Government for approval in the near future.
* Prepared the draft law on public services to contribute to the implementation of the policy of the Royal Government of Cambodia to provide public services effectively and efficiently.
In addition, the Ministry has in principle authorized ministries and institutions to recruit 5,996 new civil servants and use: 18,292 contracted staff, 7,996 contract teachers, and non-formal education contract teachers. 2,472 places and 15,615 two-shift and one-level teachers at all levels.
In addition, the Ministry of Public Works inspected the public service sector and found cases of overpayment and took measures to divert 7,198,135,514 riels to the treasury. Cracked down on 3 thieves after shocking the victim's mobile phone in Ang Snoul district
(Phnom Penh): The police force of Ang Snoul district and the patrol force of Khan Kampol, Phnom Penh, arrested 3 thieves after they shocked the victim and tried to escape.
According to Mr. Thach Sovanna, Chief of Criminal Section, Ang Snoul District Inspector, on February 4, 2020, the above operation took place on February 3, 2020 at 5:20 PM on National Road. No. 4, Prey Rokar village, Chok Chheu Neang commune, Ang Snoul district, Kandal province.
Mr. Thach Sovanna said that before the incident, the victim was riding a motorcycle from work, leaving the phone in the motorcycle club, and when he reached the above point, suddenly the suspect was riding a motorcycle with three people. He grabbed his cell phone and fled. The victim chased and shouted that the thieves had just met the police patrol and came out in cooperation with Kambol district to detain the suspect at Lech Wat village, Sangkat Kambol, Khan Kambol, Phnom Penh.
Mr. Thach Sovanna confirmed that according to the confession of the suspect, Suong Sok Meng alias Beut, he confessed that he was a motorcyclist, using a sword in his pants to seize the phone and pass it to Seng Makara, leaving it open. Escape. Before the action, they gathered to drink wine at the lot in Monorom village and then went out to do the activity.
Currently, the specialized force of Ang Snoul district inspector is building a case to send the three thieves to court.
