Please be reminded that on the occasion of attending a get-together with Cambodians in South Korea on the evening of February 3, 2020, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, announced that he will visit Cambodian students in Wuhan City. Hubei, China, if the Chinese government allows. The announcement came in response to a number of opposition groups on social media, demanding that Samdech visit Cambodian students in Wuhan, China.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated, "Please answer, Hun Sen will go!" If the Chinese government allows. You do not have to deal with Hun Sen, Hun Sen dares to fight in the flames of war, dares to use his head as capital to save the nation, dares to use his life as capital for national unity, end the war, bring national unity, what Hun Sen does not dare to go Wuhan to visit Cambodian students.
