The Prime Minister's announcement made the general Cambodian population very appreciative of the leader's willingness to travel to Wuhan, which everyone feared.
Although no one can fully comprehend this strong man, as a coffee table observer for decades, I can certainly see some of Hun Sen's wise strategy. As usual, Samdech Hun Sen, the founder of win-win politics, always did something based on the "win-win" strategy, including the coronavirus problem.
Therefore, the decision not to declare closure is the best thing to do, because even if it is announced, it will not be announced, because flights from the danger zone to Cambodia will no longer exist because the Chinese side has already closed. But what is different is that not declaring closure is able to maintain good relations and cooperation with China, which is a good friend of Cambodia. This is another important point in foreign relations.
In the case of the Coronavirus, if the opposition were to use 100% populist politics, pretending to be very patriotic and patriotic in order to please the people at one time, the great national interest would be lost.
In short, behind the decisions of Prime Minister Hun Sen are always embedded in the interests of the nation and the people. This is the strongest point of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, which made him fight 100 times, win 100 times and can stand firmly as Prime Minister for more than 35 years and will continue to hold this position for a long time.
As for the political opponents who want to defeat Samdech Techo Hun Sen by the way of politics, populism, democracy, color revolution and burning to the ground, as in the case of the coronavirus, etc., in the end, the result they get is that some fall. Others, though still alive, are not strong, and their strong legs in shouting are getting weaker and weaker like a lamp running out of oil.
