(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of February 3, 2020, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, met with people living in South Korea on the afternoon of February 3, 2020.
The following are the main remarks of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also reminded of the failure to visit Korea in November 2019 due to the illness of the mother-in-law.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also mocked the protesters against Samdech. Samdech Techo said that he only thought that the demonstration had flooded Seoul, but only a few bullets.
* Samdech Techo stated that not only in South Korea, but also in the United States and Europe, Samdech's opposition was not equal to his supporters.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia and South Korea have become mutually exclusive.
* Samdech Techo stated that in the meeting with the President and Prime Minister of South Korea, Samdech will raise the issue of finding ways for Cambodian-Korean children to speak Khmer.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen questioned how the beginning of the visit to Korea in 1996 and the decision to establish diplomatic ties with Korea have already borne fruit?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the past story between Cambodia and Korea has gone through a floating situation.
* Samdech Techo stated that the sinking was due to the problems on the Korean Peninsula and the Cold War.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the conflict between North and South Korea has changed Cambodia's diplomatic policy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech has made efforts to strike a balance between South and North Korea.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalled the development of diplomatic relations between Cambodia and South Korea until South Korea agreed to establish an embassy in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that after the explanation of the South Korean Samdech agreed to upgrade from the mission to the embassy from the mission representative to the ambassador.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the relationship between Cambodia and South Korea so far has been very successful.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if Samdech had not signed a diplomatic agreement with South Korea in 1996, there would have been no Cambodian presence in South Korea at this time.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that when Cambodia decided to establish diplomatic ties with South Korea, there were concerns affecting the relationship between Cambodia and North Korea.
* Samdech Techo stated that it is not fair that North and South Korea have seats at the United Nations, but Cambodia can not communicate with South Korea.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that because of this problem, Samdech always told diplomats that political decisions, both inside and outside the country, must be in the national interest and national independence first.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the establishment of relations between Cambodia and South Korea is a historical fact that can not be hidden.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Mr. Lee Myung-bak presented his background as Samdech's economic adviser during the election campaign.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is very proud of its efforts to facilitate the 2019 Anniversary Summit between Cambodia and South Korea to be held in Busan.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also expressed his pride that Cambodia has facilitated the upgrading of Mekong-South Korea relations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if he did not want the Cambodian people to work in South Korea, it would not be difficult, just cancel the agreement with South Korea, but Samdech did not follow the claims of the opposition.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that some illegal Cambodian workers to live in South Korea are trying to insult the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that good relations between Cambodia and South Korea must be seen.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that he was very grateful to the Korean employer for his high appreciation for the Cambodian workers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked his South Korean employer to take care of Cambodian workers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government does not allow workers to work abroad and oppress them.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2019, the trade volume is 778 million dollars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's exports to South Korea were about $ 335 million, while Cambodia's exports from Korea were about $ 696 million.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this trade relationship started from good relations between the two countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the export of mangoes for sale in South Korea, but Samdech advised to check the quality to avoid road sales.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia and South Korea can shake hands because of goodwill and business together.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that as of November 2019, South Korea has provided about 889 million USD for development loans and opened 442 million USD for use. Ready to provide another $ 700 million for the development of 10 projects from 2019 to 2023.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also expressed his intention to request South Korea to provide assistance for the construction of a bridge across the river in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the people of Stung Trang have made three prime ministers, including Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminds Cambodian workers in South Korea to work in accordance with the law in Korea and students strive to learn to help develop the country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are about 50 flights a week between Cambodia and South Korea.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that he will go to Wuhan to visit the Cambodian people there if the Chinese government allows them to go.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Samdech dared to use his life as capital to save the nation, what he did not dare to go to Wuhan to visit students.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advised to contact the Chinese government to arrange a trip to Wuhan.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had instructed Cambodian Airlines not to close flights with China.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that as long as the Chinese government allows, Samdech will visit Cambodian students in Wuhan.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalled his decision not to evacuate Cambodians in South Korea during 2015, when both Koreas faced war. Samdech considered that decision to be the right one.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants to return from South Korea to visit students in Wuhan because he had to fly through China.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that so far, many countries have suffered from coronary heart disease, so if all flights are closed. Currently, only Laos does not have the disease.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the recent outbreak of the virus is caused by climate change that the world is working together to solve. Samdech Techo stated that this problem is nothing more than a joint effort to solve it.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen expects that relations between South and North Korea will continue to improve.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told Cambodian workers in South Korea that if there is any problem in Korea in the future, please do not panic. If South Koreans live, they have to live like them.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has benefited greatly from the establishment of diplomatic relations between Cambodia and South Korea.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech was a successful man in Korean politics.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that relations with North Korea continue to not be hostile to North Korea.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to hold talks between North Korea and relevant parties.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen carried the educational books of Dr. Ou Chong and the words of the Ngoy group to the Cambodian workers in South Korea.
The announcement of Samdech Techo Hun Sen was made during a meeting with Cambodians in South Korea on the evening of February 3, 2020. The announcement came in response to a number of opposition groups on social media, demanding that Samdech visit Cambodian students in Wuhan, China.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed this: "Please answer, Hun Sen will go! If the Chinese government allows. You do not have to deal with Hun Sen, Hun Sen dares to fight in the flames of war, dares to use his head as capital to save the nation, dares to use his life as capital for national unity, end the war, bring national unity, what Hun Sen does not dare to go "Wuhan to visit Cambodian students."
Wuhan, China is the site of the first outbreak of coronary heart disease (Corona). The source of the disease has not been identified and confirmed, with the death toll rising to 362 and 17,000 infected, spreading to 24 countries around the world.
Under such circumstances, the Chinese government has announced the closure of all flights from Wuhan to provinces and cities in China, as well as to other countries in the world, to show responsibility and prevent the spread. The World Health Organization (WHO) has declared a global emergency over the spread of the deadly disease.
After announcing that he would visit the Cambodian students, Samdech Techo urged his officials to contact the Chinese side to visit the Cambodian students in Wuhan. Samdech Techo Hun Sen explained the unnecessary need to evacuate Cambodians from China as tourists from China to other countries continued to travel as usual.
Samdech questioned whether so far any Cambodians have been infected with the coronavirus. So far, there is only one Chinese national in Cambodia who is being treated at the Sihanoukville Provincial Referral Hospital and will not be allowed to leave until the national treatment.
Samdech Techo also confirmed that all high-ranking officials and tycoons who are present in Korea will accompany Samdech Techo Hun Sen to Wuhan to visit Cambodian students there.
Please be informed that regarding the safety of Cambodian students in Wuhan, Mr. Wang Wentian, Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia, on February 3, 2020, stated that the Chinese government will continue to ensure the safety and health of Cambodians. All who are living in China and provide assistance to those Cambodians are in dire need. Market vendors in Kampong Chhnang ask the provincial governor to take action to take the sidewalk as a place to shop
(Kampong Chhnang): On the afternoon of February 2, 2020, many market vendors in Kampong Chhnang Province requested the intervention of Mr. Chhour Chandoeun, Governor of Kampong Chhnang Province to take action against vendors who take public sidewalks after selling in the market. Quiet until some days not even a riel because they buy outside the market.
In particular, in front of the market and around the upper market, there is no proper parking lot because those parking lots have been sold out of order. On the other hand, mobile vendors in the provinces often come to open the market day and night from 1 week to half a month, making the traders in the market honestly pay taxes every month almost every day. Everyone is gone.
A street vendor said that street vendors were better off selling in the market and that he was not unaware that he was wrong, but that his venue had to be paid daily to be able to sell. If no one came to take money from him, they would not dare to sell it for fear of being caught.
Meas Meng Huot, director of the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police Office, said that the order on the street vendors was like a wolf, as they were not afraid of the law. They have lost their beauty, order and traffic congestion.
Regarding the above issue, he will ask the upper level to take action against those vendors, and if they are not fined, they will not be relentless.
It should be reminded that in relation to the sale of anarchy, Mr. Chhour Chandoeun has often warned the officials and authorities in charge of this work, as he has clearly defined where the street is, where the market is, and those anarchic sellers. It is not difficult to take action, but it is difficult for our officials or authorities to refuse to do so.
