(Phnom Penh): UNESCO has decided to support Cambodia in selecting a number of cities to be included in the list of innovative cities, in which UNESCO is looking at some of Cambodia's cities, especially Battambang, Kratie and Kampot, which are qualified to meet the criteria. In the UNESCO list of innovative cities.
