(Phnom Penh): On the morning of February 1, 2020, at 9:00 AM, Phnom Penh Capital Hall will hold a press conference on waste management and garbage collection to inform the people living in Phnom Penh to know more about Garbage management and garbage collection in Phnom Penh.
Phnom Penh Capital Hall spokesman Met Meas Pheakdey said that the press conference aims to explain to the people about the management and collection of garbage in Phnom Penh.
Remind the people in Phnom Penh! From 1st to 15th February, 2020 is the time when all residents of Phnom Penh have to pay the garbage collection fee for January. Garbage and solid waste collection fees in Phnom Penh are no longer linked to electricity bills.
According to the announcement of the Phnom Penh Capital Administration, for the payment of garbage collection service, people have to pay from the 1st to the 15th of the next month, and in case of failure to pay after 15 days of the end Each month will be treated as a liability subject to legal fines.
