On behalf of the leadership, members, staff and staff of the Cambodian Red Cross, I would like to express my deepest gratitude to His Majesty the Queen Mother of Cambodia, the highest revered figure. Royal support every quarter to support the humanitarian activities of the Cambodian Red Cross.
