(Pursat): Two girls, students of Hun Sen High School, riding in a motorcycle taxi in opposite directions, were hit by a Samsung car, one died at the scene and the other died while being sent to rescue.
The accident happened at 4:15 pm on January 30, 2020 on a paved road at the west point of the gate of Hun Sen Romlech High School, about 26 meters in the village of Prolay Romdenh, Romlech commune, Bakan district. Pursat.
After the incident, the police force of Bakan district measured and brought the evidence to keep waiting to deal with later. The bodies of the two victims were handed over to relatives for traditional rites.
Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of closing the meeting of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, this morning, January 31, 2020, presided over the closing ceremony of the 2019 Annual Meeting and the work direction for 2020 of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs. The closing ceremony was held at the Peace Palace.
On the morning of January 30, 2020, the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation opened the meeting and on the morning of January 31, 2020, closed the meeting to review the work achieved in 2019 and set the direction of work to be implemented. In 2020.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen Highly Appreciates and Appreciates Many Important Achievements of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs's Leaders, Officials and Staff in the Last Year in Taking a Tough Diplomatic Mission as the World Goes to a Period of Transformation Deep, uncertain and complicated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that for many years we have lived in a world that is undergoing a profound and complex change, a world that is in the process of transitioning to a complex polar system, in which Old and new characters, states and non-states, are fiercely competing to control and manage the affairs of the planet.
* The Prime Minister said that recently we have also seen the dangers that have arisen after the intervention of the great powers in the name of restoring democracy to the internal affairs of the same sovereign country, but smaller and Weaker in the Middle East, Africa, Latin America or Asia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that not only the issue of human rights and democracy, even the issue of oil palm cultivation is afraid of problems between countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that big countries should choose to help Cambodia more to help the people of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the face of competition in the world, there will be competition in uncertainty.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that as the Prime Minister, he does not work for the benefit of any country and does not harm the national interest.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the divisive issue in the European Union is a lesson for strengthening the ASEAN community.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Europe is having bad relations with ASEAN.
* Samdech Techo questioned that the strategic partnership can move fast between Europe and ASEAN if Europe has a tendency to interfere with ASEAN countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the principle of consensus is the fundamental principle for the strength of ASEAN.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that ASEAN must synthesize and capture South Korea and India for its own strength.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was pleased with the fruits of the Ministry's achievements in internal reform through the inclusion of the system of meritocracy in the appointment and promotion and professional capacity building, which in recent years This has a significant boost.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that 41 years ago, Samdech established the Ministry of Foreign Affairs directly with only three people under the age of 27.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that when the Ministry of Foreign Affairs was established, he ate cornmeal, but now diplomats have a well-dressed car.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was really proud of the development of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that when he went out to work for the first time as a Cambodian diplomat in Moscow, he did not sleep on the plane because he thought that Cambodia is small, Russia is big, Samdech Kmeng, Minister of Foreign Affairs of Russia. But in the end, Samdech thought that Cambodia, even though it was small, was a country and Samdech Kmeng represented a country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Cambodian diplomats are now very lucky, but the generation of diplomats have only $ 50 to carry.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it does not make sense if a country can not implement the law and follow the orders of any country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked all friendly countries for providing assistance for human resource development in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that only wise and loyal diplomats can promote and protect the national interests.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the hosting of the meeting, which will bring together leaders from 51 countries and heads of two regional institutions, as well as the organization of seven other events, calls for a national effort to address the financial logistics problem. Technical equipment, location, protocol and highest security. Cambodia is committed to accomplishing this with honor and success.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen officially announces the hosting of the 13th Asia-Europe Summit to be held on 16 and 17 November 2020 in Phnom Penh,
Monks and Buddhists in Kampong Thom Province Celebrate "Wat Padipatti Thutong Meditation and Understanding Meak Bochea"
(Kampong Thom): To contribute to the Royal Government of Cambodia as well as the promotion of Buddhism in the evening of Thursday, January 30, 2020, on January 30, 2020, monks and Buddhists in Kampong Thom province Held the "Wat Thotong Meditation and Understanding Meak Bochea" at Low Kim Seng Restaurant, Damrey Choan Khla Village, Sangkat Damrey Choan Khla, Stung Sen City, Kampong Thom Province.
The ceremony was also attended by Preah Moha Vimal Dhamma Pin Sen, Member of the Buddhist Parliament of the Kingdom of Cambodia, Tep Satta Sieng Sok, Preah Sattha Barami, Provincial Chief, Mr. Sok Lou, Governor of Kampong Thom Province, Mrs. Khieu Sina Chea Chanto, Mr. Ieng Sotheara, Director of Lotus Company and Lotus Foundation, including nearly 1,000 Buddhists, monks and students.
He added that this year's Meak Bochea Understanding Program was held for the second year after receiving the support of the participants in Meak Bochea Visakha and Asalobo in 2019 and asking for To the Lotus Company and the Lotus Foundation, the Priesthood of the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Buddhist University of Sihanoukville to organize every year.
Mr. Ieng Sotheara also said that the organization of the program "Practicing meditation and understanding of Meak Bochea" aims to raise awareness and encourage Buddhists to properly apply the teachings of Buddhism through Meak Bochea. And other festivals such as Vesak and Asalobo, and Meak Bochea is one of the most important festivals in Buddhism celebrated on the 15th day of Meak every year.
Mr. Ieng Sotheara said that Pink Company and Pink Foundation will continue to commit to this program in the coming years so that the Cambodian people understand the importance of the three important days and believe that this program will Promote the better implementation of Buddhist teachings for the sake of sustainability, peace, and progress in Cambodian society.
On that occasion, Mr. Sok Lou also urged young students to participate in the implementation of the teachings of the Buddha to do good deeds, especially in society, such as participation in respecting traffic laws, avoiding drugs, respect teachers. Old teachers, elders, parents who went to teach them to find the right path.
