In the closing ceremony of the conference chaired by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the morning of January 31, 2020, the Deputy Prime Minister emphasized that currently in Africa, Cambodia has only one location in Cairo, Egypt. In Latin America, however, it does not exist.
Mr. Prak Sokhon emphasized that increasing the number of missions in the world is an additional burden on the shoulders of the Royal Government. But he strongly hopes that the Royal Government will provide a bigger sail as Cambodia's boats expand to absorb the wind, pushing the boat at a speed that is in line with the pace of evolution, the situation and the changing world.
