Mr. Pov Piseth, Deputy Governor of Siem Reap Province, urged the Commune / Sangkat Chiefs, Commune / Sangkat Police Chiefs throughout the province to pay more attention to the work of collecting population statistics and to be highly responsible based on the notification. No. 1063 S.C.N. dated August 2, 2014 of the Ministry of Interior on giving priority to the work of checking the list and registering to vote for the people in the commune according to the NEC calendar.
