Ministry of Foreign Affairs organizes 2020 annual meeting to review activities and challenges in 2019
(Phnom Penh): Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, presided over the opening ceremony of the 2019 Annual Review Meeting on January 30, 2020.
