Tomorrow, January 31, the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen will preside over the closing ceremony of the conference at the Peace Palace to provide valuable recommendations and guidance for Cambodian diplomats in carrying out their diplomatic missions.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo PM will officially announce the hosting of the 13th Asia-Europe Meeting 2020 in Cambodia and foreign ambassadors to Cambodia will also be invited to participate in this ceremony. .
