The push was made on the occasion of Deputy Prime Minister Yim Chhay Ly, Representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presiding over the closing ceremony of the 2019 Annual Meeting of the Ministry of Rural Development. Sokha Phnom Penh Hotel on the afternoon of January 29, 2020.
