In this meeting, the President of the Electricity Authority of Cambodia also mentioned the plan and direction of the Electricity Authority of Cambodia to be implemented.
He said that the plan and direction of the Electricity Authority of Cambodia to implement the seven points, including:
1: Join the Ministry of Mines and Energy and Electricity of Cambodia to promote the implementation of the policy for the 243 villages that are difficult to supply to have electricity as soon as possible and continue to monitor and encourage licensees to expand the distribution network to the nearest village. People's houses for villages where the power supply line has already reached
2: Participate in promoting the provision of adequate, stable, safe and reliable electricity services.
