4: Continue activities to provide fairness in the measurement and recording of electricity consumption.
5: Continue to monitor and take action to solve the problem of overcharging, including electricity, electricity, deposit, forcing consumers to buy cables to deceive consumers about the power connection.
6: Continue to promote the connection of electricity to rented rooms, rented houses for workers, students and electricity to stalls in the market.
