This is what Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, suggested to those involved in the program to provide cash support to pregnant women and children under 2 years of age in poor families.
Mr. Vong Soth insisted at the last meeting before starting to implement the cash support program for pregnant women and children under 2 years old in poor families, this meeting was held on the morning of January 29 2020, Office of the Ministry of Social Affairs.
At the same time, Mr. TOCH Channy, Director General of Technical Director General of the Ministry of Social Affairs, also expressed the same concerns as the Minister of Social Affairs, saying that the working group has developed a number of mechanisms to monitor the implementation to ensure effective targeting and avoidance. This pro-family family and so on.
