Senior Minister Pol Saroeun Sends 396th Engineer Corps to UN Peacekeeping Mission in Lebanon
(Kampong Speu): General Pol Saroeun, Senior Minister in charge of sending Cambodian peacekeepers to the United Nations, on behalf of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, this morning, January 29, 2020, paid a visit to the 396th Engineering Corps. 184 people, 24 women, on a UN peacekeeping mission in the Republic of Lebanon.
