The Ministry of Commerce affirmed that at the opening ceremony, the two sides praised the Cambodia-China bilateral relations and noted the importance of negotiating the FTA, which contributes to strengthening ties and cooperation. Economic operations between the two countries.
According to the statement, the ministry claimed that after two days of talks, the leaders of the two countries' negotiating teams noted the positive results of the 10 working groups, exchanging views and positions with each other and agreeing. On some articles in this round of negotiations as well.
The ministry stressed that in the next step, the two sides will speed up the raising of points or proposals by each working group to reach an agreement on the agreement in the near future. In addition, the two countries' chief negotiators agreed to promote consultations and coordination in their respective countries before the second round of talks, which is scheduled to take place in Cambodia in the first half of 2020.
