The victim, Ros Srey Nith, 31, a chef living in Doeum Sleng village, Sangkat Chbar Ampov II, Khan Chbar Ampov, described in shock that before the incident, he and his mother went to the market to buy food and removed 3 grams of gold necklace and put it in a bag. Carrying and walking into the normal market, two women came and whispered that he had collected a lot of gold.
Later, two men came to ask if there was any gold. The victim was about to tell them. Suddenly, two women and two men forced them to get on the motorcycle with a knife, so they did not dare to shout and follow the suspect. Arrived 60 meters from the road and threatened to kill him if he did not let the necklace he hid in his bag.
The victim said that she also gave a gold necklace weighing 3 grams to the suspect, and then six members of the gang escaped, and the police and the school security command came to intervene, but not yet brought him to stay. Posting to file a complaint.
