(Sihanoukville): Until now, a Chinese man with a new type of respiratory disease caused by coronavirus is being treated in a separate room of the Sihanoukville Provincial Referral Hospital, according to Mam. Bun Heng, Minister of Health.
Please watch the video of sending a Chinese man with coronavirus to a separate room of Sihanoukville Provincial Referral Hospital, which was received by Sihanoukville provincial authorities and sent to Fresh News on the night of January 27, 2020. :
According to the Minister of Health, patients infected with the new coronavirus have been isolated in Sihanoukville Provincial Hospital. The Ministry of Health has already contacted the Chinese embassy and promised to treat the patients before returning.
After discovering that the Chinese national was staying at the Quinco Hotel in Sihanoukville, the Sihanoukville Provincial Health Team took the analysis in accordance with the technical specifications recommended by the Ministry of Health on the same day and sent the specimen from the nose. And the throats of the four individuals above were analyzed at the Laboratory of the Institut Pasteur du Cambodge.
The Minister continued that the main measures that the Ministry of Health and the Provincial Health Department together with the Sihanoukville Provincial Authority have now implemented are as follows:
* Place the patient in a separate room of Sihanoukville Provincial Hospital for follow-up as well as provide the most careful treatment.
* Put his family under medical surveillance and find other affected people to conduct health education and monitor their health and disinfect their place of residence.
