(Kampong Chhnang): A police officer was beaten by a group of drinkers with a pipe, breaking one of his legs while trying to stop them, they were arguing with each other. This incident happened at 11:15 AM on January 26, 2020 in Village 6, Sangkat Khsam, Kampong Chhnang Province.
Kampong Chhnang City Police, who arrived at the scene, said that the police officer who was beaten by a group of drunkards broke his leg was known as Suos Sary, a lieutenant colonel, a police officer at the Sangkat Administration Post. Khsam.
