Khan Chesa wins 2020 European Championship title
(Phnom Penh): This is considered to be another national pride of Cambodia after the heroine Khan Chesa won the European Judge Championship in 2020.
It should be noted that Khan Chesa is now 18 years old, with a Cambodian father and a Mexican mother, but obtained the same US citizenship while currently living in the United States.
Chesa entered the sport of jujitsu at an early age under the direct training of her father, and a few years later won many gold medals.
Khan Chesa is considered by the Cambodian leadership and people as a heroine after she won a gold medal at the 2018 Asian Games in Indonesia and another gold medal from the 30th SEA Games in the Philippines. In addition, Chesa has also won medals on the international stage and the world almost forgotten.
