Villagers in Po and Trangel communes ask Kampong Leng district authorities and Kampong Chhnang provincial tourism department to help establish the Bak Dao dam site
Residents in the commune of Po commune said that in 2018, the people in the community contacted the district authority to establish a tourist area at the Bak Dao dam, they asked to build a shed and build some stalls along the back of the dam. To receive local tourists as well as foreign tourists who wish to create a natural forest and mountain resort and come to dive at this dam.
Last year, the Bak Dao Dam had a full source of water due to the rainy weather, but in 2019, due to less rain, the water in the Bak Dao Dam did not have much water. Irrigation during the rainy season this year also faces some water shortages.
It should be noted that the Bak Dao Dam is an ancient historical site of King Techo Meas Techo Yot, a gathering place for ancient Khmer soldiers to train in war tactics to defend the motherland of Cambodia.
Therefore, in order for this historical site to remain in the hearts of all Cambodian children, the people of Kampong Leng district have requested the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Department of Tourism to help study the creation of the above tourist sites for national and international visitors to visit. As well as find out about this historical site.
