Sam Rainsy, who is known to have used all means and tricks to suppress Kem Sokha, wrote on Facebook and on his Twitter account: "I am very pleased to hear that Mr. Ky At least the government lawyer agreed to accept the documents and photos that I posted on Facebook as evidence in the case of Kem Sokha's treason ....
Mr. Sam Rainsy's message is clearly seen as a further mockery of Mr. Kem Sokha after he announced to the court a lot of evidence related to conspiracy with foreigners in a plan to overthrow the government. The law, while Kem Sokha is trying to justify his repeated denials of colluding with foreigners.
Mr. Sam Rainsy's actions have received strong reactions from Kem Sokha supporters and some insiders. They claim that Sam Rainsy is unemployed and is walking around in the air and seems to be too bored to say such things in the context of Mr. Kem Sokha's fierce trial in court. Sam Rainsy did this because he was afraid people would forget his name and only talk about Mr. Kem Sokha.
Especially after the government lawyer Ky Tech thanked Sam Rainsy for presenting evidence to place charges against Kem Sokha and himself, the reaction from within the former CNRP intensified. They were offended, angry, and severely reprimanded Sam Rainsy for his immoral and unethical conduct with Kem Sokha.
On the contrary, Sam Rainsy, a politician with little understanding of diplomacy and strategic weakness, openly posted and even posted photos of many foreign leaders, stating that they were helping to make it happen. There was a regime overthrow in Cambodia. This is the reason why those foreign governments are so upset and angry that they do not think that Sam Rainsy is so stupid. Those countries have warned Sam Rainsy severely.
Due to this problem, in the next message, Sam Rainsy seems to want to wash himself, wanting to distort the story that it was just a normal meeting with foreigners, which can not be used as evidence.
But Sam Rainsy forgot to think that the message he wrote on the official Facebook page and the confession on Radio Free Asia in the past were serious and gave a bad omen to Mr. Kem Sokha until the government lawyer thanked him.
According to the messages, Mr. Rainsy could not wash his hands, although he tried to write that such statements were merely to the detriment of Prime Minister Hun Sen, because in court the most important thing was evidence and witnesses.
Now I understand that Mr. Sam Rainsy is very serious because both Mr. Kem Sokha and supporters of Kem Sokha are not happy, both supporters of Sam Rainsy himself reacted to blame and moreover Mr. Sam Rainsy was also very angry. The seriousness of the foreign government, which it once considered a reliance. Please do not forget that Mr. Sam Rainsy's words have been copied and even if you want to correct it.
All in all, Sam Rainsy is now out of control, knowing full well that his name has been completely forgotten since November 9, 2019.
Therefore, in order not to be forgotten, Sam Rainsy's only choice remains to place additional burden on Kem Sokha's treason case, even if many large countries are involved in his treason case. Itself, which is a serious political mistake. This is the reason why Mr. Sam Rainsy does not give up this evil intention to put the burden on Mr. Kem Sokha, because Sam Rainsy and Kem Sokha are "one".
