(Mondulkiri): Mr. Say Sam Al, Minister of Environment, emphasized that the preservation of the culture and traditions of indigenous peoples in addition to the protection and conservation of natural resources is to promote the development of eco-tourism as a source of income to create the local economy. Provide sustainable income for the community.
