(Phnom Penh): The nationwide campaign against illegal drugs for January 22, 2020 shows that law enforcement forces have cracked down on 29 cases of illegal drugs, detaining 59 suspects.
According to the report of the Third Commission of the Anti-Drug Campaign, the types of crimes include: 22 cases of trafficking, 43 arrests (7 females) and 7 cases of use, 16 arrests.
