(Pursat): On the morning of January 22, 2020, Pursat Province will host the inauguration and official launch of the OWSO and the 25 Provincial People's Offices at the Provincial Hall. Under the high presidency of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior.
The establishment of the OWSO is to enhance the efficiency of the administration of administrative services in accordance with the principles and procedures that are simple, fast, transparent, accountable, trustworthy and non-corrupt. Pursat province is extremely proud to have been selected by the leadership of the Ministry of Interior to jointly inaugurate the OWSO of the 25 provincial capitals on this occasion.
