Deputy PM Hor Namhong: China plays an important role in the development of many countries in the world
(Phnom Penh): Deputy Prime Minister Hor Namhong has said that the People's Republic of China is the second largest economy in the world, contributing to peace, security and economic development in many parts of the world.
The Deputy Prime Minister made this remark while attending the Chinese New Year celebration organized by the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia on the night of January 21, 2020.
