At the Closing Ceremony of the 26th Private Security Agency Training Course, which was attended by nearly 200 private security agents, Lt. Gen. Lim Sokharasmey also disseminated Instruction No. 001 of the General Commission of the National Police. Such as:
* Participate in protecting security and order in temples, temples, China, Vietnam, Korea, as well as some shrines and places with various celebrations, taking care to prevent all kinds of criminal offenses, especially acts of aggression. Gangsters will be better organized
* Take care to organize traffic order, prevent congestion, make it possible for people to visit relatives or visit various resort areas with happiness and safety.
* Must cooperate with local authorities and authorities to warn people to be careful of fire, especially candles when offering fire, electric stoves, fire extinguishers and prohibit the burning of fireworks or other explosions.
Lt. Gen. Lim Sokharasmey considered that private security agencies not only have the role of protecting private property or private enterprises, but also have the duty to participate in protecting public property, social security and the lives of the people, especially as The main support force to the competent authorities.
The director of the Department of Private Security Management also instructed the private security agency, if he saw or suspected any illegal activity, whether in his position or not, must immediately report to the relevant authorities. Finally, or come to the Department of Private Security Management directly through the teacher's phone number, as well as the team provided.
