Preah Sihanouk Provincial Cam Control Officer Disseminates Food Safety Quality at Veal Renh Market, Prey Nob District
(Preah Sihanouk): For the health of the people as well as food safety, CamControl Sihanoukville Branch, with Mr. Bun Chamroeun as the Acting Branch Manager, in cooperation with the local authority, this morning, January 21, 2020, continued to promote the quality and safety Food at Veal Renh Market, Prey Nob District, Preah Sihanouk Province.
According to the Sihanoukville CamControl official, during the operation, the experts took some food samples for preliminary testing, including: fish head, dried fish, dried squid, cooking oil, cabbage and cucumber pickle to find banned chemicals that can make Affect the health of the people.
As a result, officials did not find any banned chemicals on the food and did not display any defective or out-of-date packaging of packaged food products.
At the same time, CamControl officials instructed other traders to understand and follow the law on quality control, safety of products and services to avoid affecting the health of people will be able to face the law. General Ith Sarath: Illegal recruitment must be eliminated
(Phnom Penh): General Ith Sarath, Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Joint Chiefs of Staff of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF), has stated that it is absolutely necessary to eliminate the illegal recruitment of troops without permission and must not tolerate any military officers who commit acts. Such an illegal act.
This statement was made by General Ith Sarath on the occasion that he was accompanied by General Vong Pisen at the opening ceremony of the meeting to summarize the work results of 2019 and the implementation direction of 2020 of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces.
General Ith Sarath said: "We must eliminate all illegal recruitment, and this is the only one. Be careful, this time it will not be tolerated, and let other units be careful." .
General Ith Sarath said that the promotion of promotions and changes must be made precisely, which is the highest commitment of the Commander-in-Chief and other leaders. The general also warned subordinate units to be careful when including officers in their units, so be careful that it does not happen again, which affects the management. This is the confirmation of General Ith Sarath.
In addition, General Ith Sarath stressed the need for accuracy, transparency and fairness in the retirement, which can avoid causing injustice to army officers.
General Ith Sarath added that the opposition was still plotting to overthrow the legitimate government, especially the opposition, both inside and outside the country, trying to dismantle the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces by posting messages on the media that the extremist group had. Established and so on.
