The eight recommendations made by Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng in the meeting to summarize the results of road traffic safety work in 2019 and the direction to continue this morning, January 21, 2020 include:
* First, to strengthen mechanisms at the capital-provincial level to improve the efficiency of road safety work by improving the action plan, work regime and division of duties in accordance with the clear jurisdiction.
* Third: Enforcement measures must be enforced on motorcyclists, truck drivers, workers transporting passengers and goods, especially helmets, driving licenses, transport not exceeding the limits and other safety conditions. More.
* Fourth, to strengthen the management of road infrastructure by focusing on the continued construction and repair of roads, bridges, road and traffic system adjustment, management of sidewalks, the establishment of public and private parking lots, the installation of traffic safety cameras according to priority goals. Adequate installation of traffic lights, signs and traffic safety equipment.
The capital-provincial level must establish a network of volunteers to assist the authorities in organizing traffic order in urban areas, schools, parking lots, etc. From this year onwards, we will host many national and international events that require traffic order and participation in respecting the law on road traffic by all citizens to show the traditional culture, dignity and high prestige. Our nation.
* Fifth: To promote the "Special Area of Road Safety" competition by using one city, district, and Khan as a model competition target to draw on experience to be applied to other cities, districts and Khans in the coming year.
* Sixth: Continue to improve the capacity and quality of law enforcement forces through specialized law training, as well as study and exchange experiences with other countries, and provide additional facilities and equipment for operations. At the same time, it is necessary to educate and improve the attitude, ethics and discipline to become a virtuous and professional operator.
* Seventh: To promote domestic and foreign research on good road safety work experience in order to propose amendments to the Road Traffic Law in accordance with the actual situation and to ensure effective implementation. At the same time, the implementation of relevant laws must be strictly promoted to support the effective implementation of road traffic laws.
