(Phnom Penh): The Minister of Information, Mr. Khieu Kanharith, stated that the real journalists are journalists who work under the media unit registered with the Ministry of Information and recognized by the law, while Facebook users are not journalists. .
The Minister of Information said this on the morning of January 20, 2020, during a meeting with a group of volunteer lawyers led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, led by Mr. Kitech, to plan the defense process for journalists. Work according to professional ethics.
According to Mr. Khieu Kanharith, journalists who work in accordance with professional ethics when publishing a lawsuit will be entitled to the defense of Samdech Techo's lawyer. In particular, for Facebook users, if they make comments that hurt others and are sued, they will not get this right because they are not journalists.
At the same time, Mr. Ky Tech said that Samdech Techo's group of volunteer lawyers will start defending the rights of professional journalists from today. He also pointed out that for journalists who work in accordance with professional ethics, but are sued, if you need a lawyer, Samdech Techo to help defend, must first request through the Ministry of Information.
Please be informed that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, has decided to provide his volunteer lawyer to help defend journalists who respect professional ethics when they are sued by others. The announcement of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the evening of January 14, 2020, on the occasion of Samdech inviting and having a talk with nearly 6,000 journalists at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center.
