After receiving the budget of the Chinese Red Cross on January 15, 2020, immediately, Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, sent a representative to visit and share the sadness and bring the budget. This was handed over to the families of the 36 bodies (22 males, 14 females) and the 23 injured (15 males, 8 females) in 10 provinces.
The 10 provinces are: Kampot, Prey Veng, Svay Rieng, Kandal, Sihanoukville, Takeo, Kampong Thom, Banteay Meanchey, Ratanakkiri, Battambang.
On that occasion, Mrs. Pum Chantyny, Secretary General, Ms. Men Neary Sopheak, First Secretary General, and Mr. Yulana, Second Deputy Secretary General of the Cambodian Red Cross, as well as the leaders and officials of the Cambodian Red Cross, went to four targets. .
In that, he brought the words of Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, who sent a message of sympathy and expressed his deep regret for the tragedy that happened to all the families of the victims.
Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen also wished all the injured to recover soon and prayed for the souls of the victims to go to their deaths.
At the same time, the Cambodian Red Cross officials also told the families of the dead and the injured that the government, as well as the Chinese National Red Cross Society, would like to extend our condolences to our people who were affected by the building collapse in Kep Province Recently, the Chinese Red Cross also donated $ 50,000 through the Cambodian Red Cross to help alleviate the suffering of the victims.
Therefore, the Cambodian Red Cross team visited and handed over the money to the families of the bodies and the victims immediately.
It should be noted that China Friends, as well as the Chinese National Red Cross Society, always help the Cambodian people at all times.
