After a student fainted in Krouch Chhmar district, the authorities organized a forum to promote health protection, food to parents and students
(Tbong Khmum): After a series of cases of students fainting at Krouch Chhmar Secondary School, Tbong Khmum Province, these days, on January 20, 2020, the provincial authorities and health officials organized a forum to promote health protection, food to parents and students. To understand and participate together to reduce this incident.
Mr. Hak Sok Makara, Deputy Governor, told Fresh News that under the guidance of the Minister of Health, I have cooperated with the provincial health officials, local authorities, students to organize a forum to promote health protection, food to parents and students. In village 1, village 2, village 3, Svay Khleang commune, Krouch Chhmar district, and tomorrow we will continue to hold a forum in Krouch Chhmar commune.
It should be noted that on the morning of January 20, 2020, another 10 students of Krouch Chhmar High School, Krouch Chhmar District, fainted and were sent to the District Referral Hospital.
According to the report, out of the 10 students who continued to faint, there were 6 old patients who fainted the day before and 4 new ones, and today, the total number of students who fainted increased to 52. .
