New Achievements in Bonding Nearly 6 Kilometers of Concrete Roads and 4 Drainage Sites for the People of Prek Koy Commune and Saang Phnom Commune, Saang District, Kandal Province
(Kandal): As a sign of good fortune to the people of the two communes of Saang district, a strong, beautiful concrete road with a length of 5,832 meters and 4 drains across the road, which is a brand new achievement in the era. Techo peace era under the enthusiastic shouts, smiles, closing the mouths of the people.
