Mr. Hak Sok Makara, Deputy Governor of Tbong Khmum Province, has stated that the conclusion of fainting may come from a number of factors, including:
* First: Environmental factors: Can smoke from the brick kiln behind the high school about 200 meters away and the incinerator in the school and hot weather * Second: Health factors: poor students, irregular diet, insufficient rest, in which patients lack sugar. Calcium deficiency is also related to the feeling of shock after seeing a friend faint.
(Pailin): Mr. Phan Chanthul, Governor of Pailin Province, accompanied by Mr. Cheng Nhan and Mr. Hok Sophal, Deputy Governor of Pailin Province, and his team on January 19, 2020, opened the groundbreaking ceremony for the 6-lane gravel road. , 300 meters wide, 5 meters wide, located in O Suosdey Village, Sangkat Otavao, Pailin City, Pailin Province, which is a grant from the Royal Government and the people of Japan through the Small-Scale Human Security Project (Kusanoni).
