Chinese Consulate and Siem Reap Provincial Health Department Inspected 737 Cases
(Siem Reap): Under the theme "China-Cambodia Friendship", the Chinese Consulate in Siem Reap, in collaboration with the provincial health department, has opened 737 free health screenings and treatments for people in rural areas.
According to the Consul General, 61 years after China and Cambodia established good diplomatic relations, the two countries have finally established a comprehensive strategic partnership and cooperation. Sign together on a joint destiny action plan. Over the years, the two countries have supported each other, helped each other to be good brothers, partners and loyal friends.
He added that good health is an asset that humanity is looking for. Coming here is the fourth free health screening and treatment program for rural Cambodians in Siem Reap. He hopes for the support of the Siem Reap provincial administration, which will help the program move to more rural areas.
