Mr. Hun Manet: Today's peace is the common peace of the whole Cambodian nation
(Kampong Cham): On the occasion of being the representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen at the inauguration ceremony of a red gravel road in Cheung Prey District, Kampong Cham Province, Mr. HUN Manet said that peace Today is the common peace of the whole Cambodian nation and we can not see the shortcomings and small problems and forget the value of peace, which is our life.
On January 18, 2020, Mr. Hun Manet emphasized that the war was long over, but he still remembered the consequences of the war because he had been through the flames of war. Let us be interested in the value of peace.
According to Mr. Hun Manet, grandparents, brothers and sisters who survived the war are all meritorious. The festival, given on January 7, 1979, is a historic day, a day of actual resurrection, and this festival continues to pass on to the descendants of our people.
At the same time, Mr. HUN Manet also thanked the people who trusted the leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister and always supported Samdech to have the opportunity to lead the country forward.
He claimed that the concern of Samdech Techo Prime Minister is always attached to the land with the people and always try to serve all Cambodians to keep the peace so that the people do not suffer again because of the war, strive to build Infrastructure, schools, roads, water, electricity, efforts to attract investment to build factories, create jobs and increase all kinds of opportunities for all people.
