The operation was authorized by Mr. Sin Virak, Deputy Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, and the Joint Administrative Task Force of Chamkar Mon District, led by Mr. Aing Serey Piseth, Deputy Governor of Chamkar Mon District, represented by Mr. Theng Sothol, Governor of Chamkar Mon District, with the participation of the Military Police. Khan Chamkar Mon, Sangkat Tonle Bassac Administration and Sangkat Tonle Bassac Police Station.
