In addition, to continue to help expand human resources to be more capable, so the construction of this new school building will meet the needs of our learning and teaching more efficient and quality. This new 8-storey school building is planned More than $ 240,000 million was built at the school's own budget, with classrooms, laboratories, offices and meeting rooms.
