(Phnom Penh): A former opposition group that broke away from the former CNRP has asked the Ministry of Interior to form a new opposition party and has not yet received legal rehabilitation, but dared to engage in arbitrary political activities Laws without knowing the direction of any area. Therefore, this party can be called a party that does not have enough water.
