On that occasion, the Prince expressed his deep gratitude to all the donors, especially the Governor-General Chea Chanto and Mrs., who have initiated and contributed to the construction of many achievements to Wat Botum Vatey, which is a contribution to the promotion of God. Religion is worthy of being the state religion and a place of worship for every Cambodian Buddhist.
