Prince Real Estate Signs Letter of Responsibility for 2020 Business Goals
(Phnom Penh): The old year moves into the new year! Prince Real Estate (Cambodia) Group has signed the letter of responsibility for the business goals for 2020 and the party for 2019.
The signing ceremony of the letter of responsibility for the business goals for 2020 was held on January 16, 2020. In this ceremony, the main guidelines and requirements for the work in 2020 were raised and signed. Also sign the letter of responsibility for the business goals for 2020.
According to Qiu Guoxing, in 2020, the company's operational management will focus on four areas: capital management, risk management, cost management and performance management, as well as the establishment of enterprise management mechanisms. Systematic and standardized to continuously improve quality.
In 2019, Prince Real Estate (Cambodia) Group overcomes all obstacles and difficulties and strives to move forward. In 2020, the company will continue to fulfill its responsibilities and work in solidarity with sincerity to achieve better results.
Under the warm atmosphere, Mr. Qiu Guoxing affirmed that with the joint efforts of the 1,189 employees, Prince Real Estate (Cambodia) Group and its subsidiaries and charitable organizations have achieved remarkable development. Noticeable in all areas.
By the end of 2019, Prince Real Estate (Cambodia) Group has developed 10 projects located in 6 projects in Phnom Penh and 4 projects in Sihanoukville. Meanwhile, a subsidiary of Prince Real Estate (Cambodia) Group also achieved remarkable results. The property management area of Prince Prathe (Cambodia) Management has reached 1.8 million square meters.
2019 is a great year for Prince Real Estate (Cambodia) Group. In 2020, the company will continue to develop towards higher and farther goals.
