Battambang Provincial Department of Tourism joins hands with private individuals to commit to training more human resources
(Battambang): The Department of Tourism of Battambang Province has signed a Memorandum of Understanding with Dewey International Battambang to promote the development of human resources in the tourism sector and promote the tourism sector in Battambang to grow and attract more national and international tourists. A lot.
The ceremony was held on the afternoon of January 16, 2020 at the office of DeVi International in Battambang in the presence of Mr. Soeum Bunrith, Deputy Governor of Battambang.
Mr. Khem Raksmey, Founder and CEO of the company, stated that this collaboration is to train human resources for students in the province as well as in the region to promote human resource development in tourism now and in the future.
Mr. Ouch Uphinissara, Director of the Battambang Provincial Department of Tourism, stated that because Battambang is a beautiful province, it is attractive and suitable for living, working, visiting and spending time to beautify.
