Kuy Chi Hok became the first high school student in Cambodia to represent Cambodia for an exchange visit to the United States. The student became the recipient of this scholarship after he demonstrated his ability to speak English fluently, combined with commitment and hard work.
Ji Hok is an active student in the AII Language Center and the American Intercontinental School, which participates in various knowledge competitions at both schools. At the same time, he also revealed the character of a future leader who could be a role model for the younger generation.
