The President and Principal of the AII Language Center and the American Intercontinental School are very proud to have the opportunity to send their students to study in the United States to experience the country's progress and civilization. He hopes that Ji Hok will spread the beautiful culture of Cambodia to his parents and friends in the United States in the most comprehensive way.
