(Battambang): A delegation from Ehimi Prefecture of Japan signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) on January 15, 2020 on the establishment of sisterhood and cooperation with the Battambang Provincial Administration.
Mr. Nguon Rattan: The Governor of Battambang Province warmly welcomed the delegation from Ehime Prefecture of Japan, emphasizing the potential of Battambang Province in all areas where the people live, most of them are farmers, traders and traders.
Mr. Nguon Rattan: Confirmed that the signing of the Memorandum of Understanding, the establishment of sisterhood and cooperation in order to promote the economic development of both sides in accordance with the principles, laws and regulations of the two countries. .
He said that with the encouragement and support of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, the Ministry of Commerce and the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, the two sides agreed to cooperate in accordance with the conditions to implement activities and projects leading to economic development of both parties. Two through the use of products and technologies from Ehime prefecture.
Cooperation between the two parties includes:
1. The two sides will establish a relationship based on the principles of equality, trust and mutual respect.
The two sides agreed to cooperate in trade, investment, technology development and human resources to promote economic development and inter-regional exchanges based on the principles of mutual benefit.
3. The two sides will work together to promote industrial progress, focusing on the food processing industry through the use of Ehimi's products and technologies.
4. Both sides will promote exchanges between the private sector to encourage the development of the industrial economy, exchange of human resources and other related sectors in Battambang and Ehim.
5. The two sides will work together to strengthen the exchange of information and work together to create trade opportunities, promote mutual exchanges and build closer ties between Battambang and Ehime.
Mr. Kukibina Kapora, Provincial Governor, also thanked the Battambang Provincial Administration for its warm welcome and warm welcome to the Ehimi Provincial Delegation and reached the signing of the Memorandum of Understanding.
