When the former opposition won 55 seats, which was not enough to change the government, Kem Sokha was used by foreigners to plot to overthrow the government, using the color revolution movement in the Yugoslav and Serbian revolutionary patterns. This is the serious crime of treason that Kem Sokha is facing.
