(Phnom Penh): The Minister of Health, Prof. Mam Bunheng, stated that under the past support of the Czech Republic, it has helped to improve the health of the Cambodian people, especially in reducing child and infant mortality. Newborn by providing hospital building, training and some other medical equipment.
In fact, during the handover ceremony of medical equipment to the National Children's Hospital through the bilateral project on the development of infant care in the hospital between the Government of the Czech Republic and the Royal Government of Cambodia on January 13, 2020, the Czech Republic provided a number of medical equipment There are more than 30 items, totaling more than $ 300,000.
