"Currently, the infant mortality rate is 30% of the under-one mortality rate, so if we can reduce the risk of this accident and reduce the overall infant mortality rate," he said.
Minister Mam Bunheng also requested the Czech Republic to continue this cooperation for the welfare of Cambodian children.
