Since Cambodia was liberated from the genocidal regime, the media has been an indispensable partner of the Royal Government in building and developing Cambodian society. As a leader who likes to write, likes to take notes and has a high eloquence in front of the public, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, considers the media as a left hand, right hand, nose and nose, which is important to help Samdech's leadership to achieve good results. Brilliant for the past 35 years.
