Journalists, on the other hand, are no different from three years ago. They considered the time of the Solidarity Meal with Samdech Techo Hun Sen a sacred time for them. Journalists in Cambodia consider the solidarity meal to be a great honor and value given to them by the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
