Real Estate Experts Share Knowledge of US Investment Opportunities to Cambodians
(Phnom Penh): Real estate experts from the United States on January 13, 2020 held a seminar to share knowledge on investment opportunities in the United States to the people of Cambodia at the Sunway Hotel, Phnom Penh.
Ms. Chhor Channy said that the reason for organizing this seminar is because some Cambodians do not have a clear knowledge of investing in the United States. On the other hand, she thinks that Cambodian investors who want to invest in the United States have the right to invest without high risk if they have good guidance.
According to the group leader, Cambodians have the ability to buy real estate in the United States because more Cambodians are living there. After all, her group focuses on how much money Cambodians have to spend when buying real estate in the United States, whether it is profitable or not.
Ms. Chhor Channy said that when it comes to property prices there , it depends on the area, which can range from $ 300,000 to $ 1 million or $ 2 million. She thinks her workshops and work activities are a good way to open the door for Cambodians to be able to buy things in the United States.
She claims that the standard of living of Cambodians has risen and the price of houses in Cambodia in urban areas is $ 300,000, so the cost and investment in Cambodia and the United States is not much different. For rent in Cambodia, if it goes up, it goes up, if it goes down, it goes down, which makes investment possible, but in the United States, rents do not go down, only increase every year.
According to the real estate expert, buying a home in the US through an agent and through yourself is more beneficial than buying through an agent. Experience is language because sometimes they can write on paper but do not know what paper is. On the other hand, there is no clear explanation, making his decision to buy a house in the United States also problematic.
Ms. Chhor Channy continued that for the buyer, her team explained to him before he made each decision, both buying and borrowing money, explained to him in detail about the interest, whether it is suitable for them or not, the money in Cambodia is very well organized. How this team acts as a referee so that he has the warmth to decide. She said that in the United States, there is a lot of paperwork, not that people buy a house in Cambodia with just one or two sheets, but hundreds of sheets.
The group leader also said that Cambodians have the right to buy a house in the United States without an agent. But at this stage in terms of documents, if he does not know how to prepare, he can buy the wrong house, the wrong interest, can borrow the wrong money, the wrong documents, sometimes the house can not be bought.
