(Preah Sihanouk): Officials from the Department of Environment and local authorities in Prey Nup district take legal action against the perpetrators who illegally encroached on the land of Ream National Park.
Some of the perpetrators used the method of hiring poor people to guard the land and plant crops on the land that they had occupied and caused a lot of problems, and this case was subsequently cracked down on by the authorities.
In fact, on January 11, 2020, two couples, Muon Chum Chea and Srun Srey Nen, were hired to guard the land and encroached on the land, and the police officers of the Department of Environment recorded the interrogation to stop their activities.
According to the answer, Mr. Muon Chum admitted that he and his wife have been working as land tenants since August 2018, earning 1 million riel from Thoeun every month.
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Interior will continue to hold consultative meetings with representatives of civil society organizations to review and discuss key issues related to the proposed amendments to the Law on "Associations and Non-Governmental Organizations of Civil Society Organizations". This is according to the announcement of the Ministry of Interior, which was received by Fresh News on January 13, 2020.
The general confirmed to Fresh News that the Golden Dragon exercise between the Cambodian and Chinese armies is the same as every year. But this year is a little different than previous years, because in 2020 there will be an army of Cambodia's neighbors to observe and evaluate.
"The 2020 Golden Dragon exercise will have a number of agendas, but we only emphasize counter-terrorism and humanitarian work as a priority, and at the same time we have more weapons and helicopters," he said. Also, while the prepared forces on both sides will participate more than two thousand people.
According to Major General Thong Solimo, the exercise focuses on a number of disciplines, including counter-terrorism, hostage rescue, rescue of people from natural disasters, UN operations and engineering. The main weapons used in this year's Golden Dragon exercise include: armored vehicles, tanks, artillery, mortars, helicopters and aerial support.
However, the lieutenant general confirmed that the Golden Dragon exercise between the Cambodian-Chinese army in 2020 is not a threat to any country or individual, this will be done every year and will be on a large scale. To strengthen the capacity of the Cambodian army and gain more experience from friendly countries only.
This year is the fourth Golden Dragon exercise between the Cambodian and Chinese armies, starting in 2016. What's more, this Golden Dragon exercise has more strength and weapons from year to year.
