The 27-nation parliament is composed of Australia, Cambodia, China, Japan, the Republic of Korea, Mongolia, the Russian Federation, Indonesia, Indonesia, Laos, Malaysia, the Philippines, Singapore, Thailand, Vietnam, Fiji, Macedonia, New Zealand, Papua New Guinea, the Marcel Islands, Canada, Chile, Colombia, Mexico, Ecuador, and the United States.
