The winners of the provincial qualifiers will compete for the last eight to find the top four for the semi-finals. The winners of the semi-finals will compete for the title. Working group to help Damrei commune: Peace is the most important factor in making the country grow and develop
(Kampong Thom): During the celebration of the 41st Anniversary of the January 7 Victory Day (1979-2020), the leaders and working group of Damrey Slab Commune, Kampong Svay District, Kampong Thom Province all said that peace is the main factor. In order to make the country prosperous and developed.
Mr. Ken Chhunkor stated that Victory Day, January 7, 2020, is the 41st anniversary of the historic January 7 Victory Day, 1979, which overthrew the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, saved the nation and the Cambodian people. The liberation from the most brutal regime opened a new era of independence, freedom, democracy and social progress.
He said that on the basis of the January 7 victory, the Cambodian people regained control of their homeland and their destiny. The Cambodian people have hailed the January 7 victory as their second birthday. Without the January 7 victory, we would not have everything today. The January 7 victory belongs to all Cambodians and to all human beings who love peace, freedom and justice.
Mr. Huy Savoeun said that it was not until January 7, 1979 that things like today became peaceful throughout the country, so the Cambodian people, especially the people in Damrey Slap commune, Kampong Svay district, please join in maintaining peace. Earned by this difficulty to survive further.
