(Phnom Penh): Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, said that three days after the official announcement on January 7, 2020, "personal license plate" sold more. 100 labels and earned about 1 million US dollars.
Mr. Sun Chanthol said that buying a "personal license plate" is not only easy for car owners, but it is also profitable because there is no need to pay for a license plate.
Please be informed that "Personal Special License Plate" was officially announced for sale on January 7, 2020, the 41st anniversary of the overthrow of the Khmer regime, the day the Cambodian people were resurrected.
The license plate costs from 2 million riel up to 1 billion riel, but for the auction may be more. This "personal special number plate" can select and assign names as desired, except for inappropriate words, leaders' names and historical locations.
This "personal license plate" can be purchased for life by simply deleting the name when selling the car, or they can sell the license plate when selling the whole car. The owner of the license plate can also keep this license plate for posterity, just by exchanging information about who will continue to control the license plate.
