Luo Chouchang said SingBeotech had almost completed the demarcation. The company will complete the demarcation of its border posts in the dry months of 2020 in the area adjacent to the Prey Lang Wildlife Sanctuary so that there will be no more accusations and public confusion about Sibiotec.
