A senior Iranian official has denied allegations that an Iranian missile was fired at the plane and caused it to explode. The Iranian official said the allegations were baseless, as the Iranian Ministry of Transport confirmed that during the same period many other national and international flights were also operating in the airspace. Iran is at the same altitude of 2,440 meters.
