(Phnom Penh): Mr. Oum Seiha, Second Deputy Chairman of the Central Working Group for Lvea Em District, Kandal Province, stated that the historic victory over the genocidal regime of Pol Pot on January 7, 1979 has great significance for the revival. The stability and prosperity of the motherland and the people of Cambodia, which the Cambodian people will always remember, can not forget that "January 7 is its second birthday, without the victory of January 7, there is nothing today."
Mr. Oum Seiha said this on the morning of January 10, 2020, on the occasion of the representative of Mr. Kong Vibol, First Deputy Chairman of the Central Working Group to help Lvea Em district during the celebration of the 41st anniversary of the day. Victory on January 7 (January 7, 19797 - January 7, 2020) in Lvea Em district, Kandal province, and with the participation of relevant officials, including nearly 500 people.
Mr. Oum Seiha added that after overthrowing the Pol Pot regime for 41 years on the flexible, difficult and decisive road of the CPP, led the country forward step by step overcoming all obstacles. Has made many great historical achievements for the motherland by achieving great historical achievements such as:
* First: The historic victory on January 7, 1979 saved the nation from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot and prevented this brutal regime from returning to Cambodia for the second time.
* Second: Served as the core force of national unity until reaching an agreement on a common political solution to the Cambodian conflict in Paris on October 23, 1991.
* Third: Protect and expand in a liberal, multi-party democracy, promote respect for human rights and dignity, achieve universal and non-universal elections at the national and sub-national levels in a series of fair and just manner. .
* Fourth: The success of the victorious policy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen caused the genocide of Pol Pot to completely disintegrate both the political organization and the military organization of the whole nation to achieve complete peace, national unity and territorial unity. Since the end of 1998.
* Fifth, the Royal Government has implemented comprehensive and in-depth state reforms, including public administration reform, anti-corruption reform, armed force reform, legal and judicial reform, public financial management reform, and decentralization reform. And decentralization of natural resource management, land, forestry, forestry, and the environment.
* Sixth: Rehabilitated and rebuilt the social economy from zero to stable step by step, which is the foundation for building and developing the country to progress continuously until now. In fact, the Cambodian economy has grown by more than 7% in more than 20 years.
* Seventh: Infrastructure including roads, hospitals, schools, pagodas have been rebuilt and built everywhere in Lvea Em district, there is significant development.
Ninth: Electricity is everywhere and the Royal Government has a policy to expand the supply to all villages throughout the country in the near future and the price of electricity will continue to fall gradually.
10th: The Royal Government will continue to increase the salaries of factory workers, civil servants, teachers, the Armed Forces gradually.
* Eleventh: Maintain security, public order and social security firmly, prevent the tactics of the opposition and the biased circles that used the color revolution movement, especially the plan of Sam Rainsy's return to Cambodia, which aims to overthrow the legitimate government by Protect the society from falling into a time of instability, instability, division and war again.
* Twelfth: Raise the prestige of the Kingdom of Cambodia on the international stage, have good relations and cooperation with all countries without any political regime, and have established regular relations with international organizations in the regional and global framework. He brought in a lot of support and assistance for the development of the country.
* 13th: The spirit of January 7 is still engraved in the hearts of all Cambodians and has become a great united force in creating achievements in all fields for the whole society. From year to year, in the light of peace and freedom, the Kingdom of Cambodia has developed in all areas, new achievements and successes that will occur in 2020 and the years to come.
The CPP official in Lvea Em district also urged party members and working groups to help local communes in Lvea Em district to connect with the people, serve the people wholeheartedly, and participate in implementing the party's duties and responsibilities because the people and party members At the grassroots level, it is an inexhaustible source of strength and a decisive factor in the success of the party in all circumstances.
