NagaWorld, owned by a Malaysian, is a large hotel and casino service company in Phnom Penh. After doing business in Cambodia since the late 1990s, the company has grown significantly.
Yesterday, after protesting for most of the morning, the company and the authorities called representatives of the protesters to negotiate and mediate, agreeing to increase their wages, but other conditions have not yet been met.
Khleang Soben, a table assistant at Sino Naga, told Fresh News on the morning of January 10, 2020 that this morning, the number of employees protesting exceeded yesterday, even the chefs came out to protest. She claimed that the number of protesters was about 5,000 out of a total of about 8,000 employees.
Ms. Khleang Soben continued that the company called to mediate yesterday and claimed that the wage increase was not yet clear. The company states that wages will still be paid according to the ability of the staff, without limiting the requirements of the staff, the minimum hotel staff $ 300 and at the casino $ 500.
Ms. Soben stated that currently at the hotel, cleaning and dishwashing staff only about $ 170, which is less than garment workers. In the case of the casino, the staff at the gambling table is just over $ 400, which is less than the staff at the casino in Sihanoukville.
The protesters' representatives also claimed that they were still demanding the reinstatement of union leader Chhim Sithor. Ms. Soben claimed that the dismissal of the union leader, Chhim Sithor, was not right, as he was just protesting for the working conditions of the employees in the company.
Ms. Soben said that the protesters needed the union leader, if not, they would be vulnerable to labor oppression and violations of their labor rights.
Protesters also demanded the dismissal of Romanian staff at the casino. Ms. Soben said that the foreigner oppressed the staff and imposed various fines for no reason.
Ms. Khleang Sopen emphasized that they would still protest if the company refused to comply and comply with the working conditions they demanded.
Please note that NagaWorld was established in 1995 in Phnom Penh. NagaWorld is now one of the most famous and luxurious casino hotels in Indochina, Southeast Asia and around the world.
