(Phnom Penh): Borey Rith Company presents the new Borey Rithy housing development project, covering an area of more than 10 hectares, which is located at a location with high economic potential, after being present for more than 10 years in this field, especially Set up a home protection system to avoid termite infestation.
As termites are an issue that should not be overlooked, Borey Rith has chosen to incorporate this termite protection system into the construction of its new housing project through the effective use of termite repellents. 99% in 5 years, the technology is from Germany.
The termite control team will inspect homes equipped with this system every three months to ensure that their homes are free of termites and other pests during the course of the drug.
For the next 5 years, when the effect of the drug is no longer effective, the customer can still continue to be protected with this system by simply contacting a specialist to re-inject the drug through a pre-set piping system. Stitch the beams of each house.
It should also be noted that the termite protection system is currently being installed in all homes in the new Borey Rith project, located along Street 598 in Russey Keo, Phnom Penh, which is close to many other major housing development projects. .
