Cambodia has transformed from a killing field of genocidal regimes, from a battlefield of chronic war, from a land of no freedom, from national division and division, and from a land of ashes to a land of peace, stability, freedom, democracy, the rule of law, and strong development. Every sector makes people live peacefully and hopefully for their future.
