It should be noted that the excavation of the remains of Vietnamese soldiers who lost their lives during the war in Pailin province from 2005 to the present, a total of 105 remains, especially in 2019-2020, there are information from 9 locations, a total of 27 remains, of which Pailin City has 4 sites with 10 relics and Sala Krao District has 5 sites with 17 relics.
