The cause of the house fire occurred at 2:50 pm on January 5, 2020 at the Chinese barber shop "International Style" along Monivong Blvd., house No. 539, Group 1. Village 1, Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang 2, Khan Boeung Keng Kang.
