Senior Minister Sun Chanthol said that the special license plate costs from 2 million riel up to 1 billion riel, but for the auction may be more. In addition to selecting and naming as desired, this special license plate can be stored for life by simply deleting the name when selling the car, or they can sell the license plate when selling the whole car.
According to the Minister of Public Works, the special license plate does not allow the application of some diamonds, such as obscene words, temple names, leaders and well-known institutions are also not allowed to be used. For people who use cars with normal license plates and can switch to this special license plate if they want to change.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol emphasized that the sale of this special number plate to meet the additional needs of people who want to use their own special number plate, such as want to put their favorite name or number. This special license plate allows you to pass it on to your next car when you buy a new car and pass it on to your children and grandchildren.
The Minister of Public Works claimed that the arrangement of special license plates to help generate revenue from the sale of license plates helps support the national economy and strengthen vehicle management in Cambodia.
